,"parts":[{"text":"கல்","lemma":"kal","gloss":"sound of clamor"},{"text":"என","lemma":"eṉa","gloss":"saying"}],"gloss":"with a clamoring sound"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"ஆனா","parts":[{"text":"ஆனு","lemma":"āṉu","gloss":"cease"},{"text":"ஆ","lemma":"ā","gloss":"negative relative participle suffix"}],"gloss":"ceaseless"},{"surface":"தலைக்கும்","parts":[{"text":"தலை","lemma":"talai","gloss":"afflict"},{"text":"க்கு","lemma":"kku","gloss":"future marker"},{"text":"உம்","lemma":"um","gloss":"relative participle suffix"}],"gloss":"which afflicts"},{"surface":"அறனில்","parts":[{"text":"அறன்","lemma":"aṟam","gloss":"virtue"},{"text":"இல்","lemma":"il","gloss":"without"}],"gloss":"virtueless"},{"surface":"அன்னை","parts":[{"text":"அன்னை","lemma":"aṉṉai","gloss":"mother"}],"gloss":"mother"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"தானே","parts":[{"text":"தான்","lemma":"tāṉ","gloss":"she herself"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ē","gloss":"emphasis"}],"gloss":"she herself"},{"surface":"இருக்க","parts":[{"text":"இரு","lemma":"iruttal","gloss":"to remain"},{"text":"க","lemma":"ka","gloss":"optative suffix"}],"gloss":"let her remain"},{"surface":"தன்","parts":[{"text":"தன்","lemma":"taṉ","gloss":"her"}],"gloss":"her"},{"surface":"மனையானே","parts":[{"text":"மனை","lemma":"maṉai","gloss":"house"},{"text":"ஆன்","lemma":"āṉ","gloss":"locative suffix"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ē","gloss":"emphasis"}],"gloss":"in the house itself"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"நெல்லி","parts":[{"text":"நெல்லி","lemma":"nelli","gloss":"gooseberry"}],"gloss":"gooseberry"},{"surface":"தின்ற","parts":[{"text":"தின்","lemma":"tiṉ","gloss":"eat"},{"text":"ற","lemma":"a","gloss":"past relative participle suffix"}],"gloss":"eaten"},{"surface":"முள்","parts":[{"text":"முள்","lemma":"muḷ","gloss":"thorn"}],"gloss":"thorn"},{"surface":"எயிறு","parts":[{"text":"எயிறு","lemma":"eyiṟu","gloss":"tooth"}],"gloss":"teeth"},{"surface":"தயங்க","parts":[{"text":"தயங்க","lemma":"தயங்க","gloss":"to shine"}],"gloss":"to shine","split_unverified":true}]},{"words":[{"surface":"உணல்","parts":[{"text":"உணல்","lemma":"uṇal","gloss":"eating"}],"gloss":"eating"},{"surface":"ஆய்ந்திசின்","parts":[{"text":"ஆய்ந்து","lemma":"āytal","gloss":"having selected"},{"text":"இசின்","lemma":"iciṉ","gloss":"past tense/expletive suffix"}],"gloss":"having desired"},{"surface":"ஆல்","parts":[{"text":"ஆல்","lemma":"āl","gloss":"particle"}],"gloss":"particle"},{"surface":"அவரொடு","parts":[{"text":"அவர்","lemma":"avar","gloss":"he"},{"text":"ஒடு","lemma":"ōṭu","gloss":"with"}],"gloss":"with him"},{"surface":"சேய்நாட்டு","parts":[{"text":"சேய்நாட்டு","lemma":"சேய்நாட்டு","gloss":"in the distant country"}],"gloss":"in the distant country","split_unverified":true}]},{"words":[{"surface":"விண்","parts":[{"text":"விண்","lemma":"viṇ","gloss":"sky"}],"gloss":"sky"},{"surface":"தொட","parts":[{"text":"தொட","lemma":"toṭutal","gloss":"to touch"}],"gloss":"to touch"},{"surface":"நிவந்த","parts":[{"text":"நிவந்த","lemma":"நிவந்த","gloss":"risen high"}],"gloss":"risen high","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"விலங்கு","parts":[{"text":"விலங்கு","lemma":"vilaṅkutal","gloss":"to lie across"}],"gloss":"lying across"},{"surface":"மலை","parts":[{"text":"மலை","lemma":"malai","gloss":"mountain"}],"gloss":"mountain"},{"surface":"கவாஅற்","parts":[{"text":"கவாஅற்","lemma":"கவாஅற்","gloss":"on the mountain slope"}],"gloss":"on the mountain slope","split_unverified":true}]},{"words":[{"surface":"கரும்பு","parts":[{"text":"கரும்பு","lemma":"karumpu","gloss":"sugarcane"}],"gloss":"sugarcane"},{"surface":"நடு","parts":[{"text":"நடு","lemma":"naṭutal","gloss":"to plant"}],"gloss":"planting"},{"surface":"பாத்தி","parts":[{"text":"பாத்தி","lemma":"pātti","gloss":"garden bed/plot"}],"gloss":"plot"},{"surface":"அன்ன","parts":[{"text":"அன்ன","lemma":"aṉṉa","gloss":"like"}],"gloss":"like"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"பெருங்களிற்று","parts":[{"text":"பெருங்களிற்று","lemma":"பெருங்களிற்று","gloss":"of the great male elephant"}],"gloss":"of the great male elephant","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"அடிவழி","parts":[{"text":"அடி","lemma":"aṭi","gloss":"footprint"},{"text":"வழி","lemma":"vaḻi","gloss":"path/place"}],"gloss":"in the footprint"},{"surface":"நிலைஇய","parts":[{"text":"நிலை","lemma":"nilai","gloss":"to stand"},{"text":"இய","lemma":"iya","gloss":"adjectival participle suffix"}],"gloss":"remaining"},{"surface":"நீரே","parts":[{"text":"நீர்","lemma":"nīr","gloss":"water"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ē","gloss":"emphasis"}],"gloss":"water indeed"}]}],"literal":"In the town, gossip rising, in the street, making a loud noise, / ceaselessly tormenting, mother who has no virtue, / let her remain alone in her own house! / Eating gooseberries, so that her thorn-like teeth shine, / she desired to eat with him in the distant country, / on the slopes of the high mountain that rises to touch the sky, / like a plot where sugarcane is planted, / the water remaining in the footprints of the great male elephant.","translation":"Let mother, who lacks all virtue and ceaselessly torments us while gossip rises in the town and the streets clamor, remain all by herself in her house! My friend, with her thorn-sharp teeth shining from eating gooseberries, has chosen to eat with him in that distant land, on the slopes of the high mountain rising to touch the sky, drinking the water that stands in the deep footprints of a great male elephant, which look like plots prepared for planting sugarcane.","modern":"ஊரில் அலர் எழவும், தெருவில் ஆரவாரம் உண்டாகவும், எங்களை இடைவிடாது துன்புறுத்தும் அறமற்ற அன்னை தன் வீட்டிலேயே தனியாக இருக்கட்டும்! நெல்லிக்காயைத் தின்றதால் முள் போன்ற பற்கள் விளங்க, அவள் அவரோடு தொலைதூர நாட்டில், வானைத் தொடுமளவு உயர்ந்த மலைச் சாரலில், கரும்பு நடும் பாத்தியைப் போன்ற பெரிய ஆண் யானையின் காலடித் தடத்தில் தேங்கியுள்ள நீரை விரும்பி உண்பாளாக!","explanation":"This poem is spoken by the heroine's friend (தோழி) after the heroine has eloped with her lover. The friend expresses her anger at the heroine's mother, who was unyielding and kept tormenting the heroine while the town gossiped. She wishes that the mother be left entirely alone in her house. In contrast, she describes how the heroine will happily survive in the harsh desert path with her lover. The image of the elephant's footprint holding water like a sugarcane plot shows that even in the dry, mountainous wasteland, the water they find will seem sweet and abundant to them because they are together. The 'thorn-like teeth shining from eating gooseberries' highlights the heroine's simple joy and resilience.","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"},"timing":{"male":[[0.0,0.17],[0.17,1.3],[1.3,1.5],[1.5,1.8],[1.8,2.34],[2.34,2.9],[2.9,3.17],[3.17,3.6],[3.6,4.7],[4.7,5.0],[5.0,5.33],[5.33,5.5],[5.5,5.92],[5.92,6.14],[6.14,6.73],[6.73,7.21],[7.21,7.8],[7.8,8.09],[8.09,9.23],[9.51,10.4],[10.4,10.85],[10.85,11.3],[11.3,12.0],[12.0,12.4],[12.4,13.1],[13.1,13.54],[13.65,13.8],[13.8,14.71],[14.84,15.1],[15.1,15.57],[15.57,15.8]],"female":[[0.0,0.17],[0.17,1.4],[1.4,1.6],[1.6,2.0],[2.0,2.31],[2.31,3.1],[3.1,3.57],[3.57,4.0],[4.0,4.3],[4.3,4.9],[4.9,5.5],[5.5,5.9],[5.9,7.2],[7.2,7.4],[7.82,8.03],[8.03,9.08],[9.08,9.5],[9.5,9.95],[9.95,10.55],[10.55,11.3],[11.3,11.85],[11.85,12.4],[12.4,13.2],[13.2,13.6],[13.6,14.5],[14.5,15.03],[15.18,15.4],[15.4,16.31],[16.44,16.86],[16.86,17.29],[17.29,17.5]]},"sync":[[["ஊஉர்","town"]],[["ஊஉர்","town"],["அலர்","gossip"],["எழ","to rise"]],[["சேரி","street"]],[["கல்லென","with a clamoring sound"]],[["ஆனா","ceaseless"]],[["தலைக்கும்","which afflicts"]],[["அறனில்","virtueless"]],[["அறனில்","virtueless"],["அன்னை","mother"]],[["தானே","she herself"]],[["இருக்க","let her remain"]],[["தன்","her"],["மனையானே","in the house itself"]],[["மனையானே","in the house itself"]],[["நெல்லி","gooseberry"]],[["தின்ற","eaten"]],[["முள்","thorn"],["எயிறு","teeth"]],[["தயங்க","to shine"]],[["உணல்","eating"],["ஆய்ந்திசின்","having desired"]],[["ஆய்ந்திசின்","having desired"]],[["ஆல்","particle"],["அவரொடு","with him"]],[["சேய்நாட்டு","in the distant country"]],[["விண்","sky"],["தொட","to touch"]],[["நிவந்த","risen high"]],[["விலங்கு","lying across"],["மலை","mountain"],["கவாஅற்","on the mountain slope"]],[["கவாஅற்","on the mountain slope"]],[["கரும்பு","sugarcane"],["நடு","planting"]],[["பாத்தி","plot"]],[["அன்ன","like"]],[["பெருங்களிற்று","of the great male elephant"]],[["பெருங்களிற்று","of the great male elephant"],["அடிவழி","in the footprint"]],[["நிலைஇய","remaining"]],[["நீரே","water indeed"]]]}